  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the full-screen menus (ie. settings, instance/player info or avatar/world selector) of VRChat, if you have a GraphicRaycaster anywhere in the world/scene/room (whether it is attached to the user's camera or not), it will prevent you from using the top bar; row of buttons.\n\nIt also sometimes (while you or the UI is inside another canvas) prevents the usage of the \"Escape Button Menu\", though that's a given because you got one physics plane (used for UI raycasting) blocking the other.",
